<title>USA: Capstar Hotel Q4 pro forma shr up.</title>
<headline>Capstar Hotel Q4 pro forma shr up.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, D.C. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CAPSTAR HOTEL CO</p>
<p>		     3 Mos ended 12/31	 12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p> Total Rev   30,512,558  27,413,833  122,728,059  113,998,766</p>
<p> Net Income   2,718,421     778,433    9,753,487    5,655,223</p>
<p> EPS		   0.21	  0.06	   0.76	   0.44</p>
<p>				   -ACTUAL-</p>
<p>	     Three Months Ended Dec. 31,   Year Ended Dec. 31,</p>
<p>			 1996	  1995	   1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total Revenue</p>
<p>		  32,664,062  12,152,362  109,792,222  26,363,348</p>
<p>Depreciation</p>
<p>and Amortization</p>
<p>		   2,293,072   1,131,539    8,247,649   2,097,512</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>Extraordinary Loss</p>
<p>		   2,372,201   (739,607)    4,353,360     230,576</p>
<p>Extraordinary Loss from</p>
<p>Early Extinguishment</p>
<p>of Debt, net of</p>
<p>Deferred Tax Benefit</p>
<p>			     0     887,631    1,956,180     887,631</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)</p>
<p>		  2,372,201 ($1,627,238)    2,397,180  ( 657,055)</p>
<p>NOTE: Pro forma results assume CapStar's Initial Public Offering and the acquisition of the company's initial 12 owned hotels had occurred at the beginning of the periods presented.</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per share are based on 12.75 million shares outstanding for the fourth quarter and year ended December 31, 1996 and 1995.</p>
